  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Debt Management Facility Phase III (DMF III) MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Trust Fund is to strengthen debt management to reduce debt-related vulnerabilities and improve debt transparency. This will be achieved through capacity building activities, including design and application of tailored advisory services and technical assistance, applied analytical works, trainings, webinars and peer-to-peer learning.</narrative>
  </description>
